    "en": {
      "trackName": "WristDice - RPG Roller",
      "description": "Forgot your dice at home? WristDice brings all your tabletop RPG and board game rolling needs straight to your smartwatch!\n\nSupports D4, D6, D8, D10, D12, D20, and D100. Select your die with a tap or simply shake your wrist to physically roll! Adjust the number of dice and add your modifiers (+/-) to instantly calculate your damage or saving throws. Save your most used combinations (e.g., 2d6+4) as Presets to roll them in seconds.\n\nFeatures:\n• 7 standard polyhedral dice (D4 through D100)\n• Motion integration: physically shake your wrist to roll\n• Multi-dice rolling with custom modifiers\n• Smooth spring animations and haptic feedback\n• Save unlimited Presets for frequent rolls\n• History tab with roll statistics and averages",
      "releaseNotes": "",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wristdice-rpg-roller/id6760261691?uo=4",
